In support of his contentions, learned counsel seeks reliance on the following rulings :
(i) Preeti Gupta and Another v. State of Jharkhand and Anr., (2010) 7 SCC 667;
Shivprasad Madhav Katte And Others vs The State Of Maharashtra on 2 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/111232307/
2 (ii) Rajesh Sharma & Ors. v. State of Uttar Pradesh & Anr., (2018) 10 SCC 472;
(iii) Kailashben Mahendrabhai Patel and Ors. v. State of Maharashtra and Anr.,
AIROnline 2024 SC 638 4.

